{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-tracing-practice","title":"分布式追踪实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/distributed-tracing-practice","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式追踪实践\">分布式追踪实践</h1><p>一次用户请求穿越 API Gateway → 订单服务 → 库存服务 → 支付服务 → 消息队列 → 通知服务——当 P99 延迟突增时，你需要在 10 秒内回答&quot;慢在哪个环节&quot;。分布式追踪通过在请求路径上传播 <code>trace_id</code> 和 <code>span_id</code>，将分散在数十个进程中的操作串联为一棵有向无环图（DAG），让延迟归因从猜测变为确定性推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分布式追踪的基本概念决定了“如何串联、如何采样、如何定位”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在追踪中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trace</td>\n<td>一次请求的完整调用链路（Span DAG）</td>\n<td>延迟归因的载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span</td>\n<td>一次操作单元，含起止时间与属性</td>\n<td>trace 的组成节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Context Propagation</td>\n<td>在服务/线程/消息边界传递 trace context</td>\n<td>追踪不断链的生命线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>traceparent</td>\n<td>W3C 标准的传播头</td>\n<td>默认传播格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Head Sampling</td>\n<td>SDK 层的概率采样</td>\n<td>简单低开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail Sampling</td>\n<td>Collector 层的完整 trace 决策</td>\n<td>保留有价值的异常 trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exemplar</td>\n<td>指标上指向具体 trace 的采样链接</td>\n<td>从 metric 跳到 trace</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心机制只有一条：<strong>trace_id 必须在每一次跨进程/跨线程/跨消息边界的调用中被正确传播</strong>——传播一断，trace 就退化为孤立碎片，后续所有归因能力失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"trace-数据模型\">Trace 数据模型</h2><p>一条 trace 由多个 span 组成，每个 span 代表一次操作单元：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>trace_id</code></td>\n<td>128-bit hex</td>\n<td>全局唯一，标识一次完整请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>span_id</code></td>\n<td>64-bit hex</td>\n<td>标识当前操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parent_span_id</code></td>\n<td>64-bit hex</td>\n<td>父操作 ID（root span 无此字段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>操作名（如 <code>GET /api/orders</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>start_time</code></td>\n<td>unix_nano</td>\n<td>操作开始时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>end_time</code></td>\n<td>unix_nano</td>\n<td>操作结束时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>attributes</code></td>\n<td>map</td>\n<td>业务/技术维度（如 <code>http.response.status_code=200</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>events</code></td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>时间点事件（如 exception）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>links</code></td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>关联其他 trace（如批处理关联原始请求）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>OK / ERROR / UNSET</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[Root Span&lt;br/&gt;API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;trace_id: abc123] --&gt; S1[Span: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;parent: root]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2[Span: Inventory Check&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S3[Span: Payment Process&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[Span: DB Write&lt;br/&gt;parent: S3]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S5[Span: Kafka Publish&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]&#10;    S5 -.-&gt;|异步 link| S6[Span: Notification Consumer&lt;br/&gt;新 trace,link 到原 trace]\">graph TD\n    R[Root Span&lt;br/&gt;API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;trace_id: abc123] --&gt; S1[Span: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;parent: root]\n    S1 --&gt; S2[Span: Inventory Check&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]\n    S1 --&gt; S3[Span: Payment Process&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[Span: DB Write&lt;br/&gt;parent: S3]\n    S1 --&gt; S5[Span: Kafka Publish&lt;br/&gt;parent: S1]\n    S5 -.-&gt;|异步 link| S6[Span: Notification Consumer&lt;br/&gt;新 trace,link 到原 trace]</pre><h2 id=\"context-propagation-追踪的生命线\">Context Propagation：追踪的生命线</h2><p>Context Propagation 是分布式追踪的核心机制——失去传播，trace 就断裂为孤立的碎片。</p>\n<p><strong>W3C Trace Context（默认标准）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01&#10;             │   │                                │                │&#10;             版本  trace_id (32 hex)               parent_id (16)   flags (01=sampled)&#10;&#10;tracestate: vendor1=opaque_value,vendor2=another_value\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             │   │                                │                │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             版本  trace_id (32 hex)               parent_id (16)   flags (01=sampled)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracestate: vendor1=opaque_value,vendor2=another_value</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>传播路径覆盖：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传输层</th>\n<th>传播位置</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP/gRPC</td>\n<td>Request Headers</td>\n<td>CORS 需允许 <code>traceparent</code>/<code>tracestate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kafka/RabbitMQ</td>\n<td>Message Headers</td>\n<td>必须手动 inject/extract（异步边界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC Metadata</td>\n<td>Custom metadata key</td>\n<td>OTel gRPC instrumentation 自动处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程/goroutine 切换</td>\n<td>Context 对象传递</td>\n<td>Go: <code>context.Context</code>; Java: <code>Context.current()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>异步边界是最容易断链的地方。</strong> Kafka 消息的 consumer 不与 producer 在同一进程，必须将 <code>traceparent</code> 序列化到 message header 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Producer: inject context into Kafka headers&#10;carrier := propagation.MapCarrier{}&#10;otel.GetTextMapPropagator().Inject(ctx, carrier)&#10;for k, v := range carrier {&#10;    msg.Headers = append(msg.Headers, kafka.Header{Key: k, Value: []byte(v)})&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Consumer: extract context from Kafka headers&#10;carrier := propagation.MapCarrier{}&#10;for _, h := range msg.Headers {&#10;    carrier[h.Key] = string(h.Value)&#10;}&#10;ctx = otel.GetTextMapPropagator().Extract(context.Background(), carrier)&#10;ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;process-order-event&quot;)&#10;defer span.End()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Producer: inject context into Kafka headers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">carrier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> propagation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MapCarrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetTextMapPropagator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, carrier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    msg.Headers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Headers, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Key: k, Value: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Consumer: extract context from Kafka headers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">carrier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> propagation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MapCarrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.Headers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carrier[h.Key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h.Value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetTextMapPropagator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Extract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), carrier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"process-order-event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"采样策略的工程权衡\">采样策略的工程权衡</h2><p>全量采集每条 trace 在高流量场景下成本不可承受：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>月存储成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>QPS</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>平均 span 数/trace</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>span 大小</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>86400</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>存储单价</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{月存储成本} = \\text{QPS} \\times \\text{平均 span 数/trace} \\times \\text{span 大小} \\times 86400 \\times 30 \\times \\text{存储单价}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月存储成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QPS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均</span><span class=\"mord\"> span </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span><span class=\"mord\">/trace</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">span </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">86400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存储单价</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 10,000 QPS、平均 8 span/trace、每 span 1KB 为例：月存储约 200TB。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率采样（Head）</td>\n<td>SDK</td>\n<td>简单、低开销</td>\n<td>可能丢失有价值的错误/慢 trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制采样</td>\n<td>SDK</td>\n<td>控制绝对量</td>\n<td>高峰期采样率自动降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tail-based 采样</td>\n<td>Collector Gateway</td>\n<td>可基于完整 trace 信息决策</td>\n<td>需缓存 trace 片段，增加延迟和内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级采样</td>\n<td>SDK + Collector</td>\n<td>关键路径全量，其余概率</td>\n<td>实现复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生产推荐——混合采样策略：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>SDK 层：全量发送（或 50% Head），标记 <code>RECORD_ONLY</code></li>\n<li>Collector Agent：转发到 Gateway</li>\n<li>Collector Gateway：tail-based 规则保留——错误 trace 100%、延迟 &gt; P95 100%、普通请求 5%</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"span-设计最佳实践\">Span 设计最佳实践</h2><p>好的 span 设计让 trace 瀑布图一目了然，坏的设计让它变成噪音海洋：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n<th>反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>有意义的粒度</strong></td>\n<td>每个 I/O 操作一个 span</td>\n<td>每行代码一个 span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>清晰的命名</strong></td>\n<td><code>HTTP GET /api/orders/{id}</code></td>\n<td><code>span1</code>、<code>doStuff</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>参数化路径</strong></td>\n<td><code>/api/orders/{id}</code></td>\n<td><code>/api/orders/12345</code>（高基数爆炸）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>错误标记</strong></td>\n<td><code>span.setStatus(ERROR)</code> + <code>recordException</code></td>\n<td>只设 attribute 不设 status</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>业务属性</strong></td>\n<td><code>order.total=99.50</code>, <code>user.tier=premium</code></td>\n<td>无 attribute 的空 span</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生产问题排查模式\">生产问题排查模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-延迟归因\">模式一：延迟归因</h3><ol>\n<li>从 metric 告警（P99 &gt; SLO）出发</li>\n<li>按 exemplar 找到具体 trace</li>\n<li>在瀑布图中找到最宽的 span（关键路径上的瓶颈）</li>\n<li>检查该 span 的 attribute：<code>db.query.text</code>、<code>http.response.status_code</code></li>\n<li>若有 Profile 集成，跳转到该时间窗内的 CPU/内存火焰图</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-错误传播链\">模式二：错误传播链</h3><ol>\n<li>下游服务返回 500</li>\n<li>在 trace 中看到 ERROR 状态从 DB span 开始，向上传播到 Payment → Order → Gateway</li>\n<li>DB span 的 event 记录了完整异常：<code>deadlock detected</code></li>\n<li>根因确认：并发更新同一行数据</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-异步链路断裂排查\">模式三：异步链路断裂排查</h3><ol>\n<li>消费者日志显示处理失败</li>\n<li>但无法找到对应的 producer trace</li>\n<li>检查 Kafka consumer 的 context extraction——发现 header 名大小写不匹配</li>\n<li>修复：统一使用小写 header key（HTTP/2 规范要求）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"追踪后端选型\">追踪后端选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>架构特征</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>2026 亮点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Grafana Tempo</td>\n<td>仅索引 trace_id，数据存对象存储</td>\n<td>成本敏感、高吞吐</td>\n<td>S3/GCS 原生后端，查询靠 TraceQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jaeger v2</td>\n<td>基于 OTel Collector 架构重写</td>\n<td>开源自建首选</td>\n<td>ClickHouse/Elasticsearch 后端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Honeycomb</td>\n<td>列式存储、BubbleUp 分析</td>\n<td>高基数探索性查询</td>\n<td>SLO 内置、Trace Waterfall</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于从 trace 数据衍生 RED 指标的方法，参见 <a href=\"metrics-design-patterns\">指标设计模式</a>。trace 和 SLO 的结合使用，参见 <a href=\"service-level-objectives\">SLO 与错误预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分布式追踪把请求路径上的操作串联为 DAG，让延迟归因从猜测变为确定性推理。它的生命线是 Context Propagation——HTTP/gRPC 靠 header、消息队列必须手动 inject/extract、线程切换靠 Context 对象传递，其中异步边界最易断链（header 名大小写不匹配就是典型陷阱）。生产环境采用混合采样：SDK 层全量或 50% Head 标记，Gateway 层按错误、慢请求、特定用户做 Tail 决策。好的 span 设计（有意义的粒度、参数化路径、明确的错误标记）让瀑布图一目了然，坏的设计则把它变成噪音海洋。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式追踪实践","id":"分布式追踪实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Trace 数据模型","id":"trace-数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Context Propagation：追踪的生命线","id":"context-propagation-追踪的生命线"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略的工程权衡","id":"采样策略的工程权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Span 设计最佳实践","id":"span-设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"生产问题排查模式","id":"生产问题排查模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：延迟归因","id":"模式一-延迟归因"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：错误传播链","id":"模式二-错误传播链"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：异步链路断裂排查","id":"模式三-异步链路断裂排查"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪后端选型","id":"追踪后端选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Web Vitals 与性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/web-vitals-performance"},"next":{"title":"指标设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/metrics-design-patterns"}}